                <pb facs="0534" n="1268" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1268"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Terrell</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Five thirty received. Webber’s case, Brusa, should be searchingly investigated.
                    If death proves to have resulted from cruelty or neglect, delinquent officials
                    should be sternly dealt with. Report result of investigation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
